Key Takeaways
Compute, storage and networking are the three pillars every cloud service builds on.
Security is shared: the provider secures the platform, you secure your data and access.
Elasticity plus pay-as-you-go is what makes cloud cost-efficient.
The concepts are the same across providers; only service names differ.
